data class_b_gate_witness_note: String = "Required-floor executing consumer for Class B rows 1-2 (#6985). Replaces the deleted thin-wrapper module: same transport funcs and late module name, but two claims not one — folding both rows into class_b_rows_1_and_2_hold measured 187s/1.27GB RSS on CI versus ~60s/0.28GB as separate claims, blowing the 1500ms compile-wall budget on witnesses that follow. SubstrateInputsOnly admits both rows to the hermetic manifest. Rows 3-4 stay in class_b_import_closure_binding_refusal_witness_test.dag and class_b_strip_receipt_witness_test.dag; wet integration remains run_class_b_import_closure_gate on source_root_ingest_gate."

